epistle-panel (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release. The package is a podup stack fragment: it installs
    compose.yaml under /usr/share/glyndor/epistle-panel/ with the container
    image pinned to the package version, and carries no Node runtime or
    application code.
  * Creates the glyndor-epistle-panel account, /etc/glyndor/epistle-panel/
    (with a secrets/ directory, mode 0700) and /var/lib/glyndor/epistle-panel/.
  * Generates the session secret on first install and never overwrites it. The
    epistle API token is not generated: it goes in secrets/epistle_api_token.
  * The panel listens on 127.0.0.1:7587 only.

 -- Glyndor <packages@glyndor.net>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
